kagawa_japan|Bundesliga: Dortmund's Japan tour and Kagawa|https://www.bundesliga.com/de/bundesliga/news/borussia-dortmund-vorbereitung-2026-27-tour-japan-sommer-ruckkehr-37153|Kagawa is Japanese and played for Dortmund in 2010-2012 and 2014-2019.
ownership|Bundesliga: The 50+1 rule explained|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/faq/what-are-the-rules-and-regulations-of-soccer/50-1-fifty-plus-one-german-football-soccer-rule-explained-ownership-22832|The rule refers to club members retaining 50 percent plus one vote, a majority of voting rights.
reus_move|Bundesliga: Reus announces Dortmund departure|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/marco-reus-announces-departure-from-borussia-dortmund-27217/|Reus returned to Dortmund from Gladbach in 2012.
