title01|Bundesliga: The dramatic 2001 title finish|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/bayern-munich-schalke-most-dramatic-title-finish-2001-24146|Patrik Andersson's stoppage-time indirect free kick in Hamburg secured Bayern's title. Exclude the article's inaccurate description of Rudi Assauer as coach.
title01_de|Bundesliga: Meisterdrama 2001|https://www.bundesliga.com/de/bundesliga/news/fc-bayern-munchen-fc-schalke-04-meisterdrama-2001-historisch-24061|Hamburg goalkeeper Mathias Schober handled the ball before the indirect free kick that decided the title.
hennes|Bundesliga: Hennes the goat|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/hennes-goat-cologne-living-mascot-25002|Cologne's living mascot is a goat called Hennes, gifted by circus director Carola Williams in 1950.
animal_names|Bundesliga: Animal team names|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/clubs-with-animal-names-germany-eagles-wolves-goats-foals-lions-25000|Duisburg are the Zebras because of striped shirts; Kiel are the Storks; Duisburg's Zebratwist in 1963 was the first official Bundesliga club anthem.
bochum_anthem|Bundesliga: Bochum derby celebrations|https://www.bundesliga.com/de/bundesliga/news/vfl-bochum-borussia-dortmund-sieg-masouras-tore-horn-hecking-30946|Herbert Gronemeyer's Bochum is the stadium anthem.
