darmstadt_guide|Bundesliga: Darmstadt historical guide|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/darmstadt-club-by-club-historical-guide-24215|Darmstadt are the Lilies; their part-time 1978 team trained after work; the stadium was renamed in memory of Jonathan Heimes in 2016; Dirk Schuster coached their 2015/16 survival season.
marmoush_move|Bundesliga: Marmoush says goodbye|https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/omar-marmoush-goodbye-eintracht-frankfurt-manchester-city-move-confirmed-30507|Egyptian striker Omar Marmoush left Frankfurt for Manchester City in January 2025.
